                                        "sense_id": "8fb7b4eb-b79b-39c8-b412-e16b794a9734",
                                        "entry_id": "1c5e808b-4967-3016-90ca-d6590f0fc5e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The enthusiastic acceptance or promotion of transgenderism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cad3aa9-e421-4581-b464-6747420810c8",
                                                "sense_id": "8fb7b4eb-b79b-39c8-b412-e16b794a9734",
                                                "text": "ThinkAboutIt: Do they stand to gain that much? I mean how many people are we talking about? Seeking testosterone inhibitors or estrogen shots. And surgery. Which wouldn't be BigPharm, but would at least be the medical industry.\nTeeTee: Okay, point taken, they may not be driving the transmania, but since they benefit, they're surely supporting it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d96554a2-f8fe-498e-96cc-0d69e04fe826",
                                                "sense_id": "8fb7b4eb-b79b-39c8-b412-e16b794a9734",
                                                "text": "Public acceptance of gender ideology […] reached critical mass during 2014-2015 when it exploded on the scene with a Time Magazine cover story \"The Transgender Tipping Point,\" and Vanity Fairs cover story on Olympian Bruce Jenner's new identity as female, titled \"Call Me Caitlyn.\" Popular culture was soon saturated with transmania'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "033ccc35-c4f0-4393-a0b3-0c2a6b172b92",
                                                "sense_id": "8fb7b4eb-b79b-39c8-b412-e16b794a9734",
                                                "text": "As the Left continues to alienate themselves from traditional American values with woke new versions of classic fairy tales and children's stories, conservatives have quietly begun building a parallel economy ... this has opened up a huge economic opportunity for newcomers who refuse to bend to liberal pressure to champion the transmania that has replaced common sense in corporate executive suites (Stauffer)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
